# Pattern::Dict matching a Variant with dict payload
# When a Variant has a dict payload, a dict pattern should auto-unpack and match its fields
[
  [type Config [ServerCfg host: Str port: Int] [LocalCfg]]
  cfg: [ServerCfg host: "localhost" port: 8080]
  [match cfg [host h  port p]: [str h ":" [str p]]]
]
=== error
[E002] undefined variable: ServerCfg (defined at 4:9-4:18)

=== warn
[UndefinedVariable] undefined variable: h
[UndefinedVariable] undefined variable: p
